# fixture: complement_set_before.ttl
# Purpose: baseline for setting a complement. ex:NotVehicle and ex:Vehicle are
# independent classes. Pairs with complement_set_after.ttl, where ex:NotVehicle
# becomes owl:complementOf ex:Vehicle. Defining a complement is breaking; the
# change carries before=None and after=ex:Vehicle.

@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

ex:Vehicle a owl:Class .
ex:NotVehicle a owl:Class .
